  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with a spelling change: **z→c before e** to preserve the /s/ (Latin America) or /θ/ (Spain) sound. This affects the yo form of the pretérito indefinido (crucé, not *cruzé) and every form of the subjuntivo presente and the usted/nosotros/ustedes imperative forms (cruce, crucemos, crucen).",
    "No stem change — purely an orthographic adjustment.",
    "Past participle is regular: **cruzado**.",
    "*Los personajes cruzan la línea que divide la civilización de la barbarie.* (\"The characters cross the line that divides civilization from barbarism.\")",
    "*Cruzamos la calle con cuidado.* (\"We crossed the street carefully.\")",
    "Related: *el cruce* (crossing/intersection, noun), *cruzarse* (reflexive, \"to cross paths\"), *entrecruzarse* (compound, \"to become intertwined\")."
  ],
